			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-18T14:27:21Z",
			"File": [
				"⡟⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				76,
				11
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Grove): Remove re-exports and enforce module prefix usage\n\nThis change removes convenience re-exports from mod.rs files throughout Grove, forcing all consumers to use explicit module paths. Key updates:\n\n- Remove pub use re-exports from API, Binary, Binary/Build, Common, Host, and WASM modules\n- Update init_wasm_runtime() to return Runtime::WASMRuntime and use Runtime::WASMConfig::default()\n- Update main.rs to use RuntimeBuild::RuntimeBuild and ServiceRegister::ServiceRegister fully qualified\n- Add safety lints to main.rs: #![deny(unsafe_code)], #![warn(missing_docs)], #![warn(clippy::all)]\n- Rename RuntimeBuildMod.rs→RuntimeBuild.rs and ServiceRegisterMod.rs→ServiceRegister.rs\n\nThis enforces consistent module access patterns and prevents E0255 conflicts from re-exported types.",
			"SHA": "564fc2af70bd0fb71f6d0100134edef34a3bf19b"
		},
